WEBVTT

00:00.260 --> 00:02.820
Hello, I'm Dr. Melva Wallace.

00:03.120 --> 00:06.000
This message was made
with my digital twin.

00:06.320 --> 00:11.580
I can't be in every room,
every church, every campus event.

00:11.950 --> 00:16.850
But I can still show up with a word of welcome,
a thank you, and some encouragement.

00:17.110 --> 00:21.740
Every message is approved by me
before it goes out.

00:22.100 --> 00:27.760
That's how I stay present for the people I serve,
even when my calendar says I can't.
